Aim
To develop an Android application using Kotlin that accepts two numbers from the user, performs addition, and displays the result when the Add button is clicked. 
________________________________________
Algorithm
1.	Start the application. 
2.	Initialize the UI components: 
o	First Number EditText 
o	Second Number EditText 
o	Add Button 
o	Result TextView 
3.	Enter the first number. 
4.	Enter the second number. 
5.	Click the Add button. 
6.	Read the values entered in both EditText fields. 
7.	Convert the input values into numeric data types (Double/Integer). 
8.	Add the two numbers. 
9.	Display the sum in the Result TextView. 
10.	Make the Result TextView visible. 
11.	Stop. 

